		(property "Description" "Unit bus B (units 7-12), same pins as J2 with the bus-B rails A2B_B Z2B_B A1B_B Z1B_B and LOAD_B (fed only from J5); L/T code lines and 0 V shared with J2. D-sub 25 pins: 1 A2B (a2 advance rail), 2 Z2B (a2 hold rail), 3 A1B, 4 Z1B (a1 rails), 5-9 L0..L4 (a4 = l code), 10-14 T0..T4 (a3 code), 15 LOAD (HOME preset level), 16-18 reserved (no power on signal connectors), 19-21 0 V, 22-25 reserved"
